Package: openjdk-21-jre-headless
Name: OpenJDK 21 Headless Runtime
Version: 21.0.12+ios1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Depends: libiosexec1 (>= 1.3.1)
Provides: java-runtime, java-runtime-headless
Description: OpenJDK 21 headless runtime for rootless iOS.
 Includes the arm64 HotSpot server VM with C1/C2 JIT support, the standard Java
 runtime modules, bundled FreeType, networking, crypto, JFR, and serviceability
 support. Native GUI windowing is intentionally excluded.
Maintainer: max
Author: OpenJDK contributors and Xios
Section: Development
Priority: optional
MinimumOSVersion: 16.0
